    "description": {
      "value": "<h2>Blast Fists</h2><p>Heavy gauntlets that detonate a contact blast with every powered punch.</p><h3>Blast Charges</h3><p>The gauntlets hold 3 Blast Charges.</p><p><strong>Blast Punch:</strong> 1d8 bludgeoning + 1d6 fire, spend 1 Blast Charge.</p><p><strong>Heavy Blast Punch:</strong> 1d10 bludgeoning + 2d6 fire, spend 2 Blast Charges.</p><p><strong>Blast Launch:</strong> Bonus action, spend 1 Blast Charge to propel yourself up to 10 ft.</p><p><strong>Reload Charges:</strong> Action, restore all 3 Blast Charges.</p>",
      "chat": "<p></p>"
